<title>UK: Brazil's Globo Comunicacoes sets $50 mln 2-yr bond.</title>
<headline>Brazil's Globo Comunicacoes sets $50 mln 2-yr bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Citibank International.</p>
<p> BORROWER   GLOBO COMUNICACOES E PARTICIPACOES LTDA</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  TV GLOBO LTDA, TV GLOBO DE SAO PAULO LTDA, TV GLOBO</p>
<p>		DE RECIFE LTDA</p>
<p> AMT    $50 MLN	 COUPON     9.00	MATURITY    02.OCT.98</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  PAR	 PAY DATE    02.OCT.96</p>
<p> MOODY	=	   LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    SEMI-ANN</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) 10	  SALE LIMITS US/UK/BR</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENLGISH   HOME CTRY  BRAZIL    TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF $700 MLN EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
